## Provenance

- Scan logic (WIA/TWAIN/eSCL drivers, profiles, post-processing structure)
  is ported from NAPS2 — Not Another PDF Scanner
  (https://www.naps2.com, Copyright NAPS2 Contributors, GPL-2.0-or-later).
  Ported files carry a header naming their NAPS2 origin. The C# reference
  snapshot in this repo (`naps2-in c++-master #For Reference/`) is itself
  GPL-2.0-or-later, so the licenses are compatible.
- `crates/scancraft-ui-kit/src/theme.rs`: design tokens and egui style
  derived from PdfCraft `crates/ui-egui/src/theme.rs`
  (Copyright PdfCraft contributors, MIT OR Apache-2.0,
  https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft). Permissive code inside a GPL
  project: allowed, notices retained here. Token values (light/dark color
  tables, spacing, text styles) are intentionally identical so ScanCraft
  looks like PdfCraft. Adapted: temp key renamed, font loading pointed at
  ScanCraft's own `assets/fonts`, CJK/system-fallback loading removed
  (returns with the localization milestone).
- `assets/fonts/Inter-{Regular,Medium,SemiBold}.ttf` (OFL-1.1, Rasmus
  Andersson) and `assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf` (OFL-1.1,
  JetBrains), copied from the PdfCraft checkout which vendors them under
  the same licence; see `ATTRIBUTION.toml` and `assets/fonts/OFL-*.txt`.

